          "explanation": {
            "format": "html",
            "text": "SCOPE: in the interval defined by the entire execution.<br>TRIGGER: first point in the interval.<br>REQUIRED BEHAVIOR: for every trigger, <b><i>(value = 0)</i></b> must hold at all time points between (and including) the trigger and the end of the interval."
